        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                "word": "задумчиво",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02c28ce5-fc92-3c9b-8256-835a83d0ac1a",
                        "entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к задумчивый; погрузившись в раздумья, размышления с видом человека, погружённого в мысли, размышления; выражая раздумье, размышление или свидетельствуя о них"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1befe8d0-6f99-4507-ba75-7b7a303000ff",
                                "sense_id": "02c28ce5-fc92-3c9b-8256-835a83d0ac1a",
                                "text": "Около господской усадьбы, стоявшей к улице задом, происходило, что обыкновенно происходит около господских усадеб: девки в полинялых ситцевых платьях шныряли взад и вперед; дворовые люди брели по грязи, останавливались и задумчиво чесали свои спины; привязанная лошадь десятского лениво махала хвостом и, высоко задравши морду, глодала забор; курицы кудахтали; чахоточные индейки беспрестанно перекликивались."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3b70252a-2261-37e0-8c0e-c7a9e44c5426",
                        "entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. тихо, спокойно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a275538a-ae79-44dc-bb03-9760f6361f4b",
                                "sense_id": "3b70252a-2261-37e0-8c0e-c7a9e44c5426",
                                "text": "― Какой-то странный доктор, ― задумчиво произнес Макс."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cb0a03b5-da72-4e27-bc26-9d5f56d28ec5",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "target_lang_word": "thoughtfully",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thoughtfully",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1db60cb0-1321-3f9b-bc1c-ca4beaa1c867",
                                        "entry_id": "fb62a417-7a0f-39cf-922e-68ce32e2f319",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a thoughtful or pensive manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ae129a9-88e5-478a-a1a4-00a78a5edc08",
                                                "sense_id": "1db60cb0-1321-3f9b-bc1c-ca4beaa1c867",
                                                "text": "I opened my eyes, and the first thing they fell on was the venerable countenance of our old friend Billali, who was seated by the side of the improvised bed upon which I was sleeping, and thoughtfully stroking his long beard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d51cc8fc-d3f0-44ee-aa76-64344c7863f4",
                                                "sense_id": "1db60cb0-1321-3f9b-bc1c-ca4beaa1c867",
                                                "text": "'That button, it suggests possibilities,' said Poirot thoughtfully."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e6744c4-4210-3cef-88a8-1276c396888e",
                                        "entry_id": "fb62a417-7a0f-39cf-922e-68ce32e2f319",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a way that shows kindness or consideration for others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "443732aa-56b2-4d72-804a-68e16b020c36",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "target_lang_word": "meditatively",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "meditatively",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfe0032a-5cd9-39f2-ab75-2154d647c7dd",
                                        "entry_id": "9b7bf6c9-4b27-3983-b321-faced15753a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a meditative manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86fe8eef-0f1f-4e40-b73f-a5bebd30773c",
                                                "sense_id": "bfe0032a-5cd9-39f2-ab75-2154d647c7dd",
                                                "text": "“Yes,” she said meditatively; then suddenly dropped her voice. “Mr. Hastings, you do not think—surely it could not have been Lawrence—Oh, no, that could not be!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95d544f3-0c0e-4d91-8546-a4e218cac6d4",
                                                "sense_id": "bfe0032a-5cd9-39f2-ab75-2154d647c7dd",
                                                "text": "This done, he sank on to a stretcher, and glanced meditatively about the room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da000036-8862-4f23-9818-af6288bae588",
                                                "sense_id": "bfe0032a-5cd9-39f2-ab75-2154d647c7dd",
                                                "text": "ESTRAGON: I've forgotten. (Chews.) That's what annoys me. (He looks at the carrot appreciatively, dangles it between finger and thumb.) I'll never forget this carrot. (He sucks the end of it meditatively.) Ah yes, now I remember."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ecdd6194-1a4f-4f8e-9563-af22a8ea25d4",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "target_lang_word": "musingly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "musingly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce9132db-f5ea-3bde-ae1d-52699c87f144",
                                        "entry_id": "5dcef212-da12-3550-9bd2-eb456523eeba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a musing manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cdc0a43-d030-4433-a21e-14c6d7093a5b",
                                                "sense_id": "ce9132db-f5ea-3bde-ae1d-52699c87f144",
                                                "text": "It was half-way through the morning, and he had not breakfasted; the slight litter of other breakfasts stood about on the table to remind him of his hunger; and adding a poached egg to his order, he proceeded musingly to shake some white sugar into his coffee, thinking all the time about Flambeau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5e01d19-ec5b-4e0f-8c0b-b5c5ee195b62",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc2e554d-4732-35bb-b50b-8aa134442493",
                        "target_lang_word": "reflectively",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reflectively",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46ffcb5a-b43a-3988-b7f1-0d4607b66b29",
                                        "entry_id": "e40df411-e2f7-3526-8b1e-d12924bbd6d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a reflective manner; meditatively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b1bae27-adc0-4036-82d4-5942b56c83fe",
                                                "sense_id": "46ffcb5a-b43a-3988-b7f1-0d4607b66b29",
                                                "text": "\"I should say yes,\" agreed George. \"And talk about speed!\" he added. \"Wow! One ball he threw soaked me in the ear. I can feel it yet!\" and he rubbed the side of his head reflectively."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68a9f335-ef3c-436f-b761-0136c2bbee9b",
                                                "sense_id": "46ffcb5a-b43a-3988-b7f1-0d4607b66b29",
                                                "text": "\"Spuds - Jim - Jimmy?\" he ran his fingers reflectively through his hair, and frowned. \"Bowles,\" he added triumphantly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d583cb6-99bb-42e1-81da-3958f3782020",
                                                "sense_id": "46ffcb5a-b43a-3988-b7f1-0d4607b66b29",
                                                "text": "Blake picked his teeth reflectively with the point of a clasp knife."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb66a4e2-3000-33ad-96b4-2bf1649da3da",
                                        "entry_id": "e40df411-e2f7-3526-8b1e-d12924bbd6d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By means of reflection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a78e212c-e72a-49d0-86fc-bcb38c9fb6f9",
                                                "sense_id": "cb66a4e2-3000-33ad-96b4-2bf1649da3da",
                                                "text": "In JIT compilation, the running program is reflectively modified by an embedded compiler, which only uses two reflective operations […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
